{
  "$schema": "https://agent-plugins.org/schemas/1.0.0/plugin.schema.json",
  "name": "zuihan-kanshu",
  "version": "@VERSION@",
  "description": "Answer mathematical questions, conduct sustained research, and plan, draft, or revise manuscripts with quality as the default priority. Support language and writing, improve Chinese expression, and deliver Markdown, TeX, or PDF documents.",
  "author": {
    "name": "Adjoint Functor"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/adjoint-functor/zuihan-kanshu",
  "repository": "https://github.com/adjoint-functor/zuihan-kanshu",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": ["mathematics", "research", "writing", "chinese", "latex", "agent-skills"],
  "extensions": {
    "com.openai": {
      "interface": {
        "displayName": "瑞般观珠",
        "shortDescription": "Math Q&A, research & writing",
        "longDescription": "Use ChatGPT Work for mathematical questions, sustained research, and mathematical writing in the cloud. Language and writing guidance applies while composing mathematical conversation, answers, new drafts, and revisions, in the task's language. Answers choose depth from the actual question, explicit requests, and reliable relevant background. Ordinary questions stay in conversation; manuscripts retain quality-first planning, drafting, revision, and final review.\n\nChinese guidance improves Chinese expression. Explicitly adopted Chinese translation preferences are recorded accurately and applied within their scope. During formal research, internal derivation, retrieval, and verification keep their existing workflow; guidance applies when composing the user report, preserving its established level of detail. For details, see the built-in usage guide: https://github.com/adjoint-functor/zuihan-kanshu/blob/main/skill/zuihan-kanshu/references/usage-guide.md\n\nNew writing batches begin with a saved plan and discussion by default. Intermediate rounds save sources without requiring PDF builds; suitable introductions and final language review follow the manuscript workflow. Document preparation and delivery separately provide Markdown, PDF, and optional TeX. Built-in research mini-agents provide task-based collaboration when the host supports delegation. Models, tools, and storage follow the user's instructions and host capabilities.\n\nNew saved tasks without an explicit destination use a project folder under 瑞般观珠/ at the cloud Library root, preferring the user's explicit project name or choosing one by topic, and confirming the actual folder on the first save. Existing projects keep their folder. Other environments use the available destination and report actual save results.\n\nThe name comes from the Japanese mathematical term 随伴関手 (ずいはんかんしゅ, adjoint functor), echoed in 瑞般観珠 and written 瑞般观珠 in Chinese.",
        "developerName": "Adjoint Functor",
        "category": "Education & Research",
        "websiteURL": "https://github.com/adjoint-functor/zuihan-kanshu",
        "supportURL": "https://github.com/adjoint-functor/zuihan-kanshu/issues",
        "capabilities": ["数学问答", "数学研究", "数学写作"],
        "defaultPrompt": [
          "使用瑞般观珠解答以下数学问题，并按需要给出推导、证明或文献依据。问题：……。",
          "使用瑞般观珠，围绕以下目标开展数学研究，将研究记录与阶段成果保存在云端。研究目标：……。",
          "使用瑞般观珠，根据以下要求制定数学文稿的写作计划，并保存在云端。写作要求：……。"
        ],
        "composerIcon": "./assets/icon-256.png",
        "composerIconDark": "./assets/icon-dark-256.png",
        "logo": "./assets/icon-1024.png",
        "logoDark": "./assets/icon-dark-1024.png",
        "brandColor": "#087F79",
        "brandColorDark": "#64D5C7"
      },
      "review": {
        "commerce": false,
        "commerce_description": "The plugin itself is offered without a fee and has no purchases or payment processing. Host platforms and third-party services set their own access requirements and pricing."
      },
      "publication": {
        "countries": [],
        "release_notes": "v8.6.0 brings language and writing guidance to dialogue and manuscripts and improves Chinese expression. Mathematical answers adapt to the question and reliable relevant context; formal research reports retain their established level of detail. Manuscript workflows and separate document delivery remain. New saved tasks default to project folders under 瑞般观珠/ in the Library, with explicit destinations and existing project folders preserved. NOTICE consolidates method, tool, terminology, and standards sources.",
        "translations": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "subtitle": "数学问答、研究与写作",
            "description": "请在 ChatGPT Work 中使用瑞般观珠，在云端解答数学问题、开展持续研究与数学写作。通用语言表达与写作指导从组织内容时用于数学对话、问答、文稿新写与修订，适用于各任务语言。数学回答按问题、明确要求和可靠相关背景选择详略；普通问答保留自然对话形式，文稿继续以质量为先规划、撰写、修订和审读。\n\n中文指导改善中文表现；中文翻译习惯会按用户明确需求准确记录，并在相应范围沿用。正式研究的内部推导、检索与核验保持原流程，撰写给用户的报告时才采用相应指导，保留既有简报详略。详细用法见内置指南：https://github.com/adjoint-functor/zuihan-kanshu/blob/main/skill/zuihan-kanshu/references/usage-guide.md\n\n新写作批次默认先保存计划并讨论，主体、整体修订、适用导语及最终语言审读按文稿流程完成；中间轮不要求 PDF。成品制作与交付另提供 Markdown、PDF 和按需 TeX。内置研究迷你智能体按任务采用，模型、工具与保存遵循用户指示和宿主能力。\n\n未指定目的地的新任务默认放在 Library 根目录‘瑞般观珠’下的项目子目录，优先用用户明确的项目名，否则自主按主题命名，首次保存确认实际目录。已有项目沿用原目录。其他环境按实际可用位置保存并说明。\n\n名称取意于数学术语「随伴関手」（ずいはんかんしゅ，Adjoint Functor），以其日语读音谐作「瑞般観珠」，中文写作「瑞般观珠」。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
